  {
    "id": "cite-001",
    "path": "citation",
    "role_id": "medical_archivist",
    "enabled_domains": [
      "health"
    ],
    "input": "我最新一次检查的尿酸是多少？",
    "expect_tools": [
      "query_health_record"
    ],
    "expect_absent_tools": [
      "upload_medical_report"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      {
        "kind": "tool_called",
        "name": "query_health_record"
      },
      {
        "kind": "answer_contains_value",
        "value": 488.0,
        "tolerance": 0.5
      },
      {
        "kind": "answer_absent_value",
        "value": 487.0,
        "tolerance": 0.05
      }
    ],
    "notes": "尿酸只许引 488。反向禁的是 487（记录里没有、也不落在任何参考区间里的数）——第一版在这里禁的是 5.0，理由是「别把另一条报告的数串过来」，但直径的参考区间是 0-5，一个照实报区间的正确回答会被判错。禁数必须确认它不出现在任何合法表述里。"
  },
  {
    "id": "cite-002",
    "path": "citation",
    "role_id": "medical_archivist",
    "enabled_domains": [
      "health"
    ],
    "input": "2026 年 3 月那次复查，结石直径多大？",
    "expect_tools": [
      "query_health_record"
    ],
    "expect_absent_tools": [],
    "assertions": [
      {
        "kind": "tool_called",
        "name": "query_health_record"
      },
      {
        "kind": "answer_value_near_marker",
        "value": 6.0,
        "marker": "2026",
        "window": 40
      },
      {
        "kind": "answer_absent_value",
        "value": 6.1,
        "tolerance": 0.02
      }
    ],
    "notes": "配对断言：6.0 必须挨着 2026 出现 —— 光「文本里有 6」的话，把 6 说成 2025 年那次也算过。反向那条只禁 6.1（一个记录里不存在、也不在任何参考区间里的数）。曾经禁的是 5.0，三遍全挂且模型三遍都答对了：它照实报了「参考区间 0-5」，那个 5 是区间上限不是旧报告 —— 见 _check_assertions 里那段注释。"
  },
  {
    "id": "cite-003",
    "path": "citation",
    "role_id": "medical_archivist",
    "enabled_domains": [
      "health"
    ],
    "input": "2025 年 5 月那次超声，结石直径是多少？",
    "expect_tools": [
      "query_health_record"
    ],
    "expect_absent_tools": [],
    "assertions": [
      {
        "kind": "tool_called",
        "name": "query_health_record"
      },
      {
        "kind": "answer_value_near_marker",
        "value": 5.0,
        "marker": "2025",
        "window": 40
      }
    ],
    "notes": "与 cite-002 成对：同一个指标、两份报告、两个方向。只留一条的话，「总是答最新那个数」这一族错永远测不出来 —— 它对 cite-002 恰好是对的。"
  },
